  'palm-grove-residence', 'Palm Grove Residence', 'Ikate, Lekki', '₦540,000,000', 'A minimalist duplex with clean lines and warm natural light throughout.',
  ARRAY['Palm Grove Residence sits on a quiet close in Ikate, a short drive from Lekki''s main retail and business strip. The design keeps a low, minimalist profile, with dark timber cladding set against wide expanses of glass.', 'Inside, an open-plan kitchen and living area is built around a central island, with sliding doors that open the whole ground floor onto a landscaped rear garden. Bedrooms upstairs are quiet and light-filled, each with fitted storage.', 'Every system in the home, from lighting to security, is wired for smart control, making it a fit for buyers who want a modern, low-maintenance base close to Lekki''s core without sacrificing space.']::text[],
  'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585153490-76fb20a32601?q=80&w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop',
